+## Route by quota pace
+
+Pace = used % / % of the window elapsed. The daily budget per side is 15% of the week. Over daily budget means today's burn is above 20%.
+
+Check pace at session start and before each Important packet. Use the statusline or Line Hub. These rules override normal model and review routing. Use the strictest rule that applies.
+
+| Codex quota | Route |
+| --- | --- |
+| Pace <= 1.0 and used < 70% | Use the normal routing table. |
+| Pace > 1.0 to 1.3, used 70-84%, or over daily budget | Send Standard-B with <= 3 files and a runnable VALIDATE to `gpt-6-sol` high. Do not use Luna for exploration. Use a Claude Explore subagent. Layer 2 = Fable subagent. |
+| Pace > 1.3 or used 85-94% | Use Codex only for Important/Critical. Send Standard work to an Opus subagent with the same packet. Do not resume. Fix the packet and start fresh. |
+| Used >= 95% | Do not use Codex. Opus subagent = worker. Fable subagent = layer 2. Write `worker=opus` in the ledger. |
+
